{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.YoungDiagramCornerReindex","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.YoungDiagramCornerReindex","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.YoungDiagramAddCell","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedPartitionShape","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBranchingRule"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.sum_corner_eq_sum_addable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.sum_corner_eq_sum_addable","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramCornerReindex.lean#L127-L143","doc":"**The exchange as a double-sum reindexing.**  Summing over `(λ, removable corner)` at size\n`n + 1` — with the summand read on the *erased* diagram — is summing over `(ν, addable corner)` at\nsize `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.sum_addPair_flat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.sum_addPair_flat","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramCornerReindex.lean#L118-L125","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.sum_cornerPair_flat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.sum_cornerPair_flat","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramCornerReindex.lean#L109-L116","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.addPairEquivSigma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.addPairEquivSigma","kind":"def","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramCornerReindex.lean#L101-L107","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.fintypeAddableCells","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.fintypeAddableCells","kind":"instance","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramCornerReindex.lean#L93-L99","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.isAddableCell_mem_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.isAddableCell_mem_bound","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramCornerReindex.lean#L76-L91","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.sum_cornerPair_eq_sum_addPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.sum_cornerPair_eq_sum_addPair","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramCornerReindex.lean#L67-L73","doc":"**The outer branching exchange as a sum reindexing.**  Summing a function of\n(diagram of size `n`, addable corner) over all such pairs is the same as summing it, pulled back\nalong the exchange, over (diagram of size `n + 1`, removable corner). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.fintypeAddPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.fintypeAddPair","kind":"instance","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramCornerReindex.lean#L63-L65","doc":"`AddPair`'s finiteness comes free from the exchange — no separate bound on addable cells. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.fintypeCornerPair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.fintypeCornerPair","kind":"instance","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramCornerReindex.lean#L60-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.cornerPairEquivSigma","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.cornerPairEquivSigma","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramCornerReindex.lean#L49-L58","doc":"`CornerPair` repackaged as a `Sigma` over the diagram.  Nothing moves, so both round-trips are\n`rfl`; this is the harmless direction of the subtype-vs-`Sigma` phrasing choice recorded on\n`cornerAddEquiv` (the `Sigma` form of *that* bijection is the one that produces `HEq`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.fintypeDiagramsOfCard","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.fintypeDiagramsOfCard","kind":"instance","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/YoungDiagramCornerReindex.lean#L44-L47","doc":"Young diagrams with `n` cells form a finite type — transported from `Nat.Partition n`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}